    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>The Archangel · уровень 6</b></p><p>While in your Avatar of the Archangel form, when you hit a creature with an attack, you can force it to make a<br>Strength saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it is Restrained until the end of your next turn as spectral chains lash around it.<br>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of once).</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>В книге НЕ указано восстановление использований. Счётчик есть, автосброс не придуман; решение ведущей. Требуется Avatar.</li></ul>"
    },
